<p>Ran Main Shabbir Ko Zibha Kartay Howay Shimar Ne Khud Suna&nbsp;<br> Akhri Waar Tak</p> 
<p>Pyase Shabbir Kay Zakhmi Honton Pe Tha Naam Abbas Ka&nbsp;<br> Akhri Waar Tak</p> 
<p>1) Zair e Khanjar Tha Bhai Ka Sookha Gala<br> Kuch Qadam Door Thi Zainab e Aliya&nbsp;<br> Bhai Kehta Raha Lout Jao Behan&nbsp;<br> Khushk Gardan Pe Jis Waqt Khanjar Chala<br> Dekh Kar Pehla Waar Ayse Zainab Giri<br> Shimr Hasta Raha&nbsp;<br> Akhri Waar Tak</p> 
<p>2) Youn To Sattar Qadam Pe The Zainab Khadi&nbsp;<br> Kuch Qadam Agay Bali Sakina Bhi Thi&nbsp;<br> Apne Baba Kay Seene Pe Soti The Jo&nbsp;<br> Ladkhadatay Howay Khak Par Gigayi&nbsp;<br> Baap Ko Dekh Kar Beti Roti Rahi Shimr Seene Pe Tha&nbsp;<br> Akhri Waar Tak&nbsp;</p> 
<p>3) Khainchta Tha Kabhi Resh Shabbir Ke&nbsp;<br> Marta Tha Wo Hans Kar Tamacha Kbhi&nbsp;<br> Paon Rakhta Tha Zakhmon Pe Shabbir Kay<br> Or Kabhe Jism Per Marta Tha Churi&nbsp;<br> Khoon He Khoon Tha Zakhm He Zakhm Thay&nbsp;<br> Itna Mara Gaya<br> Akhri Waar Tak</p> 
<p>4) Shimr Se Shah Ka Jab Gala Na Kata<br> Pas Sanaan Ibne Anas Agaya&nbsp;<br> Mar Kar Neza Shabbir Kay Halq Main<br> Ayse Khaincha Hui Zulm Ke Inteha&nbsp;<br> Agaye Sath Main Sari Sookhi Ragain&nbsp;<br> Neza Uljha Raha&nbsp;<br> Akhri Waar Tak</p> 
<p>5) Bughz Kitna Tha Ibne Ali Se Usay<br> Shimr Jaldi Main Tha Pehle Hi Waar Se&nbsp;<br> Ran Main Wo Dono Hathon Se Masroof Tha&nbsp;<br> Ek Pyase Ka Sar Kaatnay Kay Liye<br> Uske Ek Hath Main Tegh Aur Doosra Hath Balon Main Tha&nbsp;<br> Akhri Waar Tak</p> 
<p>6) Ek Maa God Main Rakh Kay Betay Ka Sar&nbsp;<br> Kab Say Bethi Hai Yay Shimr Ko Kab Khabar&nbsp;<br> Sath Shabbir Kay Fatima Ka Lahoo&nbsp;<br> Beh Kay Khanjar Se Girta Raha Khaak Per&nbsp;<br> Kat Gaye Ungliyan Phir Bhi Sar Na Bacha&nbsp;<br> Hath Maa Ne Rakha&nbsp;<br> Akhri Waar Tak</p> 
<p>7) Aye Raza Or Zeeshan Dekho Zara&nbsp;<br> Karbala Main Hai Moujud Wo Qatl Gaah<br> Baith Kar Aa Rotay Hain Zaer Jahan&nbsp;<br> Kal Wahan Shah Ka Koi Apna Na Tha&nbsp;<br> Sab Tamashai Thay Dekhtay Hi Rahe&nbsp;<br> Sheh Ka Kat-ta Gala&nbsp;<br> Akhri Waar Tak</p>